<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Form 990-PF Template</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        td { padding: 4px 8px; text-align: left; }
        .header-row td { font-weight: bold; }
        .form-label { font-weight: normal; }
    </style>

<style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        td, th { padding: 8px 0; text-align: left; }
        .header { font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <div>
            <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">Form 990-PF</h1>
            <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 5px;">Department of the Treasury</p>
            <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Internal Revenue Service</p>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: right;">
            <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">OMB No. 1545-0052</div>
            <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">1996</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <p style="font-size: 12pt;">For calendar year <span data-field="tax_year">{{ tax_year }}</span>, or tax year beginning <span data-field="tax_year_start">{{ tax_year_start }}</span>.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Note: The organization may be able to use a copy of this return to satisfy state reporting requirements.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <div style="width: 48%;">
            <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Use the IRS <span data-field="instructions_ref">{{ instructions_ref }}</span>.</p>
            <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Otherwise, please print <span data-field="instructions_ref_2">{{ instructions_ref_2 }}</span>.</p>
            <p style="font-size: 12pt;">See Specific <span data-field="instructions_ref_3">{{ instructions_ref_3 }}</span>.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 48%;">
            <p style="font-size: 12pt;">A Employer identification number</p>
            <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Number and street (or P.O. box number if mail is not delivered to street address)</p>
            <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Room/suite</p>
            <p style="font-size: 12pt;">B State registration number (see Instruction F)</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <p style="font-size: 12pt;">C If exemption application is pending, check here <span data-field="exemption_pending_check">{{ exemption_pending_check }}</span></p>
        <p style="font-size: 12pt;">D Foreign organizations, check here <span data-field="foreign_org_check">{{ foreign_org_check }}</span></p>
        <p style="font-size: 12pt;">E If private foundation status was terminated, check here <span data-field="terminated_check">{{ terminated_check }}</span></p>
        <p style="font-size: 12pt;">F If the foundation is in a 60-month termination period, check here <span data-field="termination_period_check">{{ termination_period_check }}</span></p>
        <p style="font-size: 12pt;">G If address changed, check here <span data-field="address_changed_check">{{ address_changed_check }}</span></p>
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Part I Analysis of Revenue and Expenses (The total of amounts in columns (b), (c), and (d) may not necessarily equal the amounts in column (a) (see page 8 of the instructions)).</h2>

    <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <thead>
            <tr class="header-row">
                <td style="width: 10%;">1</td>
                <td style="width: 35%;">Revenue</td>
                <td style="width: 15%;">a) Revenue and other support</td>
                <td style="width: 15%;">b) Net investment income</td>
                <td style="width: 25%;">c) Adjusted net income</td>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>1</td>
                <td>Contributions, gifts, grants, etc., received (attach schedule)</td>
                <td><span data-field="revenue_contributions">{{ revenue_contributions }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>2</td>
                <td>Contributions from split-interest trusts</td>
                <td><span data-field="revenue_split_interest">{{ revenue_split_interest }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>3</td>
                <td>Interest on savings and temporary cash investments</td>
                <td><span data-field="revenue_interest">{{ revenue_interest }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="revenue_net_investment_income">{{ revenue_net_investment_income }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>4</td>
                <td>Dividends and interest from securities</td>
                <td><span data-field="revenue_dividends">{{ revenue_dividends }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="revenue_dividends_net_investment_income">{{ revenue_dividends_net_investment_income }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>5</td>
                <td>Gross rents</td>
                <td><span data-field="revenue_gross_rents">{{ revenue_gross_rents }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>6</td>
                <td>Net rental income or (loss)</td>
                <td><span data-field="revenue_net_rental">{{ revenue_net_rental }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>7</td>
                <td>Net gain or (loss) from sale of assets not on line 10</td>
                <td><span data-field="revenue_gain_loss_sale">{{ revenue_gain_loss_sale }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>8</td>
                <td>Capital gain net income (from Part IV, line 2)</td>
                <td><span data-field="revenue_capital_gain">{{ revenue_capital_gain }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>9</td>
                <td>Income modifications</td>
                <td><span data-field="revenue_income_modifications">{{ revenue_income_modifications }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>10</td>
                <td>Losses from less returns and allowances</td>
                <td><span data-field="revenue_losses_returns">{{ revenue_losses_returns }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>b</td>
                <td>Less: Cost of goods sold</td>
                <td><span data-field="revenue_cogs">{{ revenue_cogs }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>c</td>
                <td>Gross profit or (loss) (attach schedule)</td>
                <td><span data-field="revenue_gross_profit">{{ revenue_gross_profit }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>11</td>
                <td>Other income (attach schedule)</td>
                <td><span data-field="revenue_other_income">{{ revenue_other_income }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>12</td>
                <td>Total (add lines 1 through 11).</td>
                <td><span data-field="revenue_total">{{ revenue_total }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="total_net_investment_income">{{ total_net_investment_income }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="total_adjusted_net_income">{{ total_adjusted_net_income }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Operating and Administrative Expenses</h2>

    <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <thead>
            <tr class="header-row">
                <td style="width: 10%;">13</td>
                <td style="width: 35%;">Operating and Administrative Expenses</td>
                <td style="width: 15%;">a) Salaries and wages</td>
                <td style="width: 15%;">b) Other operating expenses</td>
                <td style="width: 25%;">c) Total operating expenses</td>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>13</td>
                <td>Compensation of officers, directors, trustees, etc.</td>
                <td><span data-field="expense_officer_comp">{{ expense_officer_comp }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>14</td>
                <td>Other employee salaries and wages</td>
                <td><span data-field="expense_employee_salaries">{{ expense_employee_salaries }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>15</td>
                <td>Pension plans, employee benefits</td>
                <td><span data-field="expense_pension">{{ expense_pension }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>16a</td>
                <td>Legal fees (attach schedule)</td>
                <td><span data-field="expense_legal_fees">{{ expense_legal_fees }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>16b</td>
                <td>Accounting fees (attach schedule)</td>
                <td><span data-field="expense_accounting_fees">{{ expense_accounting_fees }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>17</td>
                <td>Other professional fees (attach schedule)</td>
                <td><span data-field="expense_other_professional">{{ expense_other_professional }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>18</td>
                <td>Interest</td>
                <td><span data-field="expense_interest">{{ expense_interest }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>19</td>
                <td>Taxes (attach schedule) (see page 11 of the instructions)</td>
                <td><span data-field="expense_taxes">{{ expense_taxes }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>20</td>
                <td>Depreciation (attach schedule) and depletion</td>
                <td><span data-field="expense_depreciation">{{ expense_depreciation }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>21</td>
                <td>Occupancy</td>
                <td><span data-field="expense_occupancy">{{ expense_occupancy }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>22</td>
                <td>Travel, conferences, and meetings</td>
                <td><span data-field="expense_travel">{{ expense_travel }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>23</td>
                <td>Printing and publications</td>
                <td><span data-field="expense_printing">{{ expense_printing }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>24</td>
                <td>Other expenses (attach schedule)</td>
                <td><span data-field="expense_other">{{ expense_other }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>25</td>
                <td>Total operating and administrative expenses (add lines 13 through 24)</td>
                <td><span data-field="total_operating_expenses">{{ total_operating_expenses }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td><span data-field="total_operating_expenses_sum">{{ total_operating_expenses_sum }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Operating, Gifts, Grants, and Disbursements</h2>

    <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <thead>
            <tr class="header-row">
                <td style="width: 10%;">26</td>
                <td style="width: 35%;">Total expenses and disbursements (add lines 24 and 25)</td>
                <td style="width: 15%;"></td>
                <td style="width: 15%;"></td>
                <td style="width: 25%;"></td>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>27a</td>
                <td>Excess of revenue over expenses and disbursements (line 12 minus line 26)</td>
                <td><span data-field="excess_revenue_expenses">{{ excess_revenue_expenses }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>b</td>
                <td>Net investment income (if negative, enter -0-)</td>
                <td><span data-field="net_investment_income_negative">{{ net_investment_income_negative }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>c</td>
                <td>Adjusted net income (if negative, enter -0-)</td>
                <td><span data-field="adjusted_net_income_negative">{{ adjusted_net_income_negative }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px;">Part II Balance Sheets</h2>

    <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <thead>
            <tr class="header-row">
                <td style="width: 10%;">1</td>
                <td style="width: 35%;">Cash—non-interest-bearing</td>
                <td style="width: 15%;">a) Book Value</td>
                <td style="width: 15%;">b) Fair Market Value</td>
                <td style="width: 25%;">c) Fair Market Value</td>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>2</td>
                <td>Savings and temporary cash investments</td>
                <td><span data-field="asset_savings_book">{{ asset_savings_book }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="asset_savings_fmv">{{ asset_savings_fmv }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>3</td>
                <td>Accounts receivable</td>
                <td><span data-field="asset_receivable_book">{{ asset_receivable_book }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="asset_receivable_fmv">{{ asset_receivable_fmv }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>4</td>
                <td>Less: allowance for doubtful accounts</td>
                <td><span data-field="asset_allowance_doubtful">{{ asset_allowance_doubtful }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>5</td>
                <td>Pledges receivable</td>
                <td><span data-field="asset_pledge_receivable">{{ asset_pledge_receivable }}</span></td>
