    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Part III Analysis of Changes in Net Assets or Fund Balances</h2>

    <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <thead>
            <tr class="header-row">
                <td style="width: 10%;">1</td>
                <td style="width: 35%;">Total net assets or fund balances at beginning of year—Part II, column (a), line 30, (must agree with end-of-year figure reported on prior year's return)</td>
                <td style="width: 15%;"></td>
                <td style="width: 15%;"></td>
                <td style="width: 25%;"></td>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>2</td>
                <td>Enter amount from Part I, line 27a.</td>
                <td><span data-field="change_from_part_i_27a">{{ change_from_part_i_27a }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>3</td>
                <td>Other increases not included in line 2 (itemize)</td>
                <td><span data-field="change_other_increases">{{ change_other_increases }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>4</td>
                <td>Add lines 1, 2, and 3.</td>
                <td><span data-field="total_increases">{{ total_increases }}</span></td>
                <td></td>
                <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
